/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 63 0 R
/T (The objective of this presentation is to understand the concept of Content Delivery Networks \(CDNs\) and their importance in modern cloud computing. It explains how CDN architecture works, why organizations use it to improve performance, and how it enhances the speed, reliability, and security of web applications through a real-world example.)
/E (The objective of this presentation is to understand the concept of Content Delivery Networks \(CDNs\) and their importance in modern cloud computing. It explains how CDN architecture works, why organizations use it to improve performance, and how it enhances the speed, reliability, and security of web applications through a real-world example.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
