/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 64 0 R
/T (What is a Content Delivery Network \(CDN\)? A Content Delivery Network \(CDN\) is a geographically distributed network of servers that stores cached copies of web content and delivers them from the server closest to the user. This minimizes the distance data travels, resulting in faster page loading, lower latency, and a smoother user experience.)
/E (What is a Content Delivery Network \(CDN\)? A Content Delivery Network \(CDN\) is a geographically distributed network of servers that stores cached copies of web content and delivers them from the server closest to the user. This minimizes the distance data travels, resulting in faster page loading, lower latency, and a smoother user experience.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
